Bundle-Name: SensiNact Mqtt Southbound Adapter
Bundle-Description: Mqtt Adapter that is able to extract an mqtt payload and deserialize it, 
providing there is a model available for it (if not locally, in the Model Atlas) and, if also
a sensinact mapping is available (if not locally, in the Model Atlas) then the data is pushed
to SensiNact

-workingset: SensiNact

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.emf.ecore.xmi;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.emf.osgi.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.mapping;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.southbound.common;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.sensinact.gateway.southbound.mqtt.mqtt-client;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.framework;version=latest

